Intended use
------------
This map is intended to use for the tryptophan 1La transition in proteins. This is especially useful for examining the dynamics of the protein using fluorescence spectroscopy. 

How to use
----------
This map is intended to be used with the dipole-dipole coupling should the protein have multiple tryptophans. More advanced coupling maps are not implemented.
The map merges the minor charges on HB1 and HB2 into CB to allow treatment of united atom models.

Available parameters
--------------------
At this point the frequency map has no options or parameters.

Warnings that can be raised by this map
---------------------------------------
At this point none
